    {
      "id": "-aV_A9jvZ82-AHMavxz3h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2234.522407731163,
      "y": 788.308168619744,
      "width": 3578.78369140625,
      "height": 579.6279962089964,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 495867656,
      "version": 134,
      "versionNonce": 790026760,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1768027518571,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problem:\n1. Databases are powerful but locked behind SQL. Non-technical users can’t access data, and developers waste time writing repetitive queries.\n2. Accessing databases requires writing SQL. Non-technical users can’t do it, and developers waste time writing repetitive queries\n\nSo the real problem isn’t generating SQL — it’s executing the right SQL safely.\n\n1. AI-powered system that allows users to interact with a database using simple English, while guaranteeing safety, correctness\n2. Multi-agent architecture. Instead of directly executing AI-generated SQL, we break the problem into controlled stages\n",
      "fontSize": 51.52248855191078,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problem:\n1. Databases are powerful but locked behind SQL. Non-technical users can’t access data, and developers waste time writing repetitive queries.\n2. Accessing databases requires writing SQL. Non-technical users can’t do it, and developers waste time writing repetitive queries\n\nSo the real problem isn’t generating SQL — it’s executing the right SQL safely.\n\n1. AI-powered system that allows users to interact with a database using simple English, while guaranteeing safety, correctness\n2. Multi-agent architecture. Instead of directly executing AI-generated SQL, we break the problem into controlled stages\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
